---
import { BRAND_INFO } from '../data/restaurantData';
---

<section id="story" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-[#F7F4EB] text-[#0F0F0F] border-t border-[#0F0F0F]/10 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10 sm:mb-14 text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#965C00]/30 text-[#965C00] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 shadow-sm">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#965C00]"></span>
        <span>OUR STORY & HERITAGE</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#0F0F0F] leading-tight">
        Built on Food. <span class="text-[#D01B1B]">Rooted in Sewa.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#0F0F0F]/80 font-editorial italic max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        It started with a small hearth on the Dewas Naka highway, a few people in the kitchen, and a timeless belief: <span class="text-[#0F0F0F] font-semibold not-italic">food is never just about filling a plate. It is about how you make someone feel.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2-Column Balanced Editorial Narrative Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-stretch">
      
      <!-- Left Column (7 Cols): Distilled Heritage & Founding Discipline -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-9 border border-[#0F0F0F]/10 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] h-full">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-[#0F0F0F]/10 mb-5">
            <span class="font-display text-xs font-bold text-[#965C00] uppercase tracking-widest">
              THE HIGHWAY BEGINNINGS
            </span>
            <span class="bg-[#F7F4EB] text-[#965C00] border border-[#965C00]/30 text-[10px] font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded">
              ROOTS SINCE 1980
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#0F0F0F]/80 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            <p>
              In 1980, Nanaksar began as a humble highway hearth at Dewas Naka. <strong class="text-[#0F0F0F] font-bold">Avtar Singh (Veer Ji)</strong>, working side by side with his father and a small kitchen team, served wholesome, slow-cooked meals to long-distance travelers. There were no marketing campaigns—only honest food, pure discipline, and the warmth of treating every guest like family.
            </p>
            <p>
              At the center of the kitchen was the <strong class="text-[#842F06] font-bold">sacred spirit of sewa</strong>: genuine humility, patient simmering on traditional bhattis, and consistent taste. As Indore grew, families embraced Nanaksar as their second home, turning a humble highway stop into a multi-generational dining tradition.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Motto Highlight Callout -->
          <div class="mt-6 p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#F7F4EB] border-l-4 border-[#D01B1B] border-t border-r border-b border-[#0F0F0F]/10">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#842F06] uppercase tracking-widest block">
              THE FOUNDING PHILOSOPHY
            </span>
            <p class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#D01B1B] mt-0.5 leading-tight">
              Ghar Jaisa Swad. Seva Wala Pyar.
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#0F0F0F]/85 font-sans italic mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              "Because for us, the best meals are the ones that leave you with a satisfied stomach, a warm memory, and the feeling that you were truly looked after."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column (5 Cols): Bespoke Luxury Founder Portrait Frame -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col h-full">
        <div class="w-full bg-white rounded-3xl p-3.5 sm:p-4 border-2 border-[#E4A834]/40 shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(228,168,52,0.12)] relative overflow-hidden group flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
          <!-- Ambient Gold Glow Flare -->
          <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-40 h-40 rounded-full bg-[#E4A834]/15 pointer-events-none blur-xl"></div>
          
          <!-- Portrait Container with Flexible Filling Height to Match Left Column -->
          <div class="relative w-full rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-[#181818] border border-[#0F0F0F]/10 shadow-inner flex-1 min-h-[280px] sm:min-h-[320px]">
            <img
              src="/assets/Founder.png"
              alt="Avtar Singh (Veer Ji) - Founder of Nanaksar Dhaba"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 ease-out select-none"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
            
            <!-- Signature Card Style Badge for Founder -->
            <div class="absolute top-3.5 right-3.5 bg-[#D01B1B] text-white font-display text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded shadow-sm">
              FOUNDER
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Brass-Inspired Architectural Nameplate -->
          <div class="pt-4 pb-2 px-2 text-center">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold tracking-[0.25em] text-[#965C00] uppercase block">
              FOUNDER & CUSTODIAN
            </span>
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-[#0F0F0F] mt-0.5 leading-tight">
              Avtar Singh <span class="text-[#842F06] font-editorial normal-case italic">(Veer Ji)</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#0F0F0F]/85 font-sans italic mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              "Nurturing Indore with authentic bhatti flavors and unconditional sewa since 1980."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
